		{
			"id": "eW9O8WgD9PTtEAtGE",
			"description": "Tactical Dreadnought Armour, Tartaros Pattern (Heretic)",
			"local_notes": "Weak Points 4: when a hit on this armour fails to penetrate, roll 3d; on 4 or less it found a gap and DR is halved against it.\n\nEffective SM +1 while worn. Basic Move -1, and DX-based fine work at an extra -1. Requires the black carapace interface. Worn seals and joints: Weak Points 4.\n\nLore: Tartaros was built for boarding actions in the Heresy, and the Traitor Legions kept every suit they had. Chaos Terminators are the elite of a warband; their plate is old, stained and often fused with sigils, spikes and trophies.\n\nDesign: DR (torso 190, arms and legs 165, neck 128, face 140, eye 142, hand 115, foot 140), servo ST (lifting 18, striking 9), SM +1, Basic Move -1, weight 250 lb and cost are those of the loyalist Tartaros entry, included unchanged. Weak Points 3 to 4 (framework.md, Chaos: Terminator 3 to 4).",
